// Rust Syntax/effects_surface.rs:1-924. Non-generated syntax vocabulary.
// Main's assembly manifest imports this private fragment into the one Compiler
// unit with Syntax/Spellings.jet, Registry/InterpolationSelectors.jet,
// Generics.jet and Registry/PerformanceBudgets.jet. Existing spellings and
// selector types/functions stay at their canonical owners. BUILTIN_TAGS reads
// the generated Registry/EmbeddedCoreData.jet payload through EmbeddedCore.
// Diagnostic tombstones are not accepted aliases: retain their exact bytes so
// parser/formatter retirement diagnostics can distinguish them.

